{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-21-1","title":"Psalms 21:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A thanksgiving for victory; 7 with confidence of further success.</p>\n<p>(Title.) A psalm.This is the people's [epinikion,] or song of triumph, after the victory for which they prayed in the former Psalm.</p>\n<p>The king. 2:6; 20:6,9; 63:11; 72:1,2; Isa 9:6,7; Mt 2:2 joy. 28:7; 62:7; 95:1; 99:4 in thy. 20:5; 71:17-24; 118:14,15; Heb 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-2","title":"Psalms 21:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>2:8,9; 20:4,5; 92:11; Isa 49:6-12; Heb 7:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-3","title":"Psalms 21:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>preventest. 18:18; 1Sa 16:13; 2Sa 2:4; 5:3; Job 41:11; Ro 11:35 blessings. 31:19; 2Ch 6:41; Ro 2:4; Eph 1:3 settest. 2Sa 12:30; 1Ch 20:2; Heb 2:9; Re 19:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-4","title":"Psalms 21:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>asked. 13:3; 16:10,11; 61:5,6; 119:77,175 length. 72:17; 89:29,36,37; 91:16; Re 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-5","title":"Psalms 21:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>glory. 3:3; 62:7; 2Sa 7:8,9,19; Isa 49:5-7; 63:1; Joh 13:31,32; 17:1,5,22 Php 2:9-11; Heb 8:1; Re 5:8-13 honour. 110:1; 1Ch 17:11-15,27; Mt 28:18; Eph 1:20-22; 1Pe 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-6","title":"Psalms 21:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>made. Heb. set him to be blessings. 72:17-19; Ge 12:2; Lu 2:10,11,30-32; Ac 3:26; Ga 3:9,14; Eph 1:3 made him exceeding glad. Heb. gladdened him with joy. 4:6,7; 16:11; 45:7; 63:2-5; Ac 2:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-7","title":"Psalms 21:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>For the. 13:5; 18:2; 20:7,8; 26:1; 61:4,6,7; 91:2,9,10; 1Sa 30:6; Mt 27:43 Heb 2:13 most. 9:2; De 32:8,9 he shall. 16:8; Da 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-8","title":"Psalms 21:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>2:9; 18:1; *title 72:9; 89:22,23; 110:1,2; 1Sa 25:29; 31:3; 2Sa 7:1; Am 9:2,3 Lu 19:14,27; 1Co 15:25; Heb 10:28,29; Re 19:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-9","title":"Psalms 21:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Thou. Ge 19:28; Da 3:20-22; Mal 4:1; Mt 13:42,50; 25:41,46; 2Th 1:8 Re 20:14 the Lord. 56:1,2; 106:17; Job 6:3; La 2:2 in his. 2:5,12; Mt 22:7; 1Th 2:16; Re 6:16,17; 19:15 the fire. 18:8; De 32:22; Isa 26:11; Na 1:6; Mt 3:10,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-10","title":"Psalms 21:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>37:28; 109:13; 1Ki 13:34; Job 18:16-19; 20:28; Isa 14:20; Mal 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-11","title":"Psalms 21:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>imagined. 2:1; 10:2; 31:13; 35:20; Jer 11:18,19; Eze 11:2; Mt 21:46; 26:4,5 Ac 5:27,28 are not. 83:4; Isa 7:6,7; 8:9,10; Mt 2:8,16; 27:63,64; 28:2-6; Ac 4:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-12","title":"Psalms 21:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Therefore. 9:3; 44:10; 56:9 make, etc. or, set them as a butt. Job 7:20; 16:12,13; La 3:12 back. Heb. shoulder. thou shalt. 7:13; 18:14; 64:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-21-13","title":"Psalms 21:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":21,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":21,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Be thou. 18:46; 46:10; 57:5,11; 72:18,19; 113:5; *marg: 1Ch 29:11; Job 9:19; Mt 6:10,13; Re 11:17 so will. 58:10,11; Re 15:3,4; 16:5-7; 18:20; 19:1-6</p>"}]}